Hi there,

indeed, nothing happend with this run. No output, and a error message from the mcapply() function. I don't lnow what I could do to run it in all cores. I've ran some examples from the mcapply function and it worked, but not the BioGeoBEARS.

i'm trying to switch PC's but with no success. Well, i'm with hands tied. Any suggestions?

Cheers.

